Slot a is ready. Nothing changes until the next boot; slot b and /data are as they were.
  Reboot:     g14-adb.sh -a 127.0.0.1:44045 shell reboot      then: g14-adb.sh -a 127.0.0.1:44045 wait && g14-adb.sh -a 127.0.0.1:44045 ota-status
